# Ownership lanes for ΗΛΕΙΑ PULSE.
#
# This file is the enforced version of CLAUDE.md's Team Notes. The split is by
# LAYER, not by feature: Mavroeidis owns everything that talks to Supabase or
# builds the app; Margaris owns everything that renders, and consumes that API.
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern, so order here is deliberate:
# broad default first, then the backend claims, then the frontend claims that
# override them (the i18n files live under src/lib/ but are product copy).
#
# Turn this into enforcement rather than documentation: Settings -> Branches ->
# rule on `main` -> "Require review from Code Owners". GitHub then blocks a
# merge that touches the other person's lane without their approval.
#
# Both of us are called Giorgos. @GeorgeMavroeidis is Mavroeidis,
# @GeorgeMargaris is Margaris. Read the surname, not the first name.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- default ---
# Anything not claimed below needs Mavroeidis, who owns the repo's plumbing.
*                                       @GeorgeMavroeidis

# ------------------------------------------- Mavroeidis: the backend layer ---
# Data access, domain logic, the database, and the build. Nothing here renders.
/src/lib/                               @GeorgeMavroeidis
/supabase/                              @GeorgeMavroeidis
/scripts/                               @GeorgeMavroeidis
/.github/                               @GeorgeMavroeidis

# Build, deploy and dependency surface.
/package.json                           @GeorgeMavroeidis
/package-lock.json                      @GeorgeMavroeidis
/vite.config.ts                         @GeorgeMavroeidis
/vite.static.config.ts                  @GeorgeMavroeidis
/wrangler.toml                          @GeorgeMavroeidis

# ---------------------------------- Margaris: the frontend / mobile layer ---
# Everything a user looks at, plus the shells that mount it. These override the
# default above, and the src/lib/ claim for the two copy files at the end.
/src/components/                        @GeorgeMargaris
/src/routes/                            @GeorgeMargaris
/src/hooks/                             @GeorgeMargaris
/src/styles/                            @GeorgeMargaris
/src/styles.css                         @GeorgeMargaris
/public/                                @GeorgeMargaris

# The production entry point. `npm run build` builds from here, not src/routes/,
# so this is the mount that actually ships. It was previously unowned.
/cloudflare-static-src/                 @GeorgeMargaris

# Mobile shell. Capacitor wraps the same static build into the iOS app.
/capacitor.config.ts                    @GeorgeMargaris
/ios/                                   @GeorgeMargaris

# Product copy. Sits under src/lib/, but the words belong to the product voice,
# and last match wins.
/src/lib/i18n.tsx                       @GeorgeMargaris
/src/lib/hp/i18n.ts                     @GeorgeMargaris

# ------------------------------------------------------ shared, by design ---
# Either of us may propose changes; both should see them.
/CLAUDE.md                              @GeorgeMavroeidis @GeorgeMargaris
/IDEAS.md                               @GeorgeMavroeidis @GeorgeMargaris
/SECURITY.md                            @GeorgeMavroeidis @GeorgeMargaris
